<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"></view><view class="nav"><text class="nav-back" bindtap="goBack">‹</text><text class="nav-title">账号管理</text></view><view wx:if="{{savedAccount}}" class="card result-card"><text class="result-title">{{savedAccount.created ? '账号已开通' : '账号已更新'}}</text><text>人员：{{savedAccount.name}}</text><text>手机号：{{savedAccount.mobile}}</text><text>角色：{{savedAccount.roleLabel}}</text></view><view class="card form-card"><view class="section-title">开通或重置登录账号</view><text class="tip">企业微信账号已存在时将更新手机号、角色并重置密码；密码请通过可信渠道单独告知本人。</text><view class="field"><text>手机号</text><input type="number" placeholder="请输入11位手机号" value="{{mobile}}" bindinput="onMobileInput" maxlength="11" /></view><view class="field"><text>企业微信账号</text><input placeholder="例如：LinWenKai" value="{{wecomUserId}}" bindinput="onUserIdInput" maxlength="128" /></view><view class="field"><text>人员姓名</text><input placeholder="请输入姓名" value="{{name}}" bindinput="onNameInput" maxlength="60" /></view><view class="field"><text>人员角色</text><picker range="{{roles}}" value="{{roleIndex}}" bindchange="chooseRole"><view class="picker">{{roles[roleIndex]}}<text>›</text></view></picker></view><view class="field"><text>初始/重置密码</text><view class="password-input"><input placeholder="8位以上，包含字母和数字" value="{{password}}" bindinput="onPasswordInput" password="{{!showPassword}}" maxlength="64" /><text bindtap="togglePassword">{{showPassword ? '隐藏' : '显示'}}</text></view></view><view class="field"><text>确认密码</text><input placeholder="请再次输入密码" value="{{confirmPassword}}" bindinput="onConfirmInput" password="{{!showPassword}}" maxlength="64" /></view><button class="primary-button create-button" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="save">保存账号</button></view></view>
